om/\">here</a>.</div></li><li><div data-contents-type=\"text\">You can claim and check the progress of ongoing Twitch Drops <a href=\"https://link.twitch.tv/MyDropsInventory\">here</a>.</div></li></ul><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\"><strong>All Channels: Advanced Access Rewards (September 30 - October 4)<br></strong></span>Start: September 30, 2026 at 06:00 PDT / October 1, 2026 at 15:00 CEST</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">End: October 4, 2026 at 23:59 PDT / October 5, 2026 at 8:59 CEST</div><div class=\"tableWrapper\"><table class=\"x_x_MsoNormalTable sticky-top\"><colgroup><col><col><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px; background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong>Watch Time</strong></span></div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px; background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong>Reward</strong></span></div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px; background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong>Qty</strong></span></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">15 min</span></div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">Cyber Glasses (Skin: Eyewear) (Bound)</span></div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">x1</span></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">30 min</span></div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">Customization Voucher (Bound)</span></div></td><td style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\"><div data-con